  "ruleText": "Ins 3702.01 Purpose and Scope. This part establishes the standards for the notice to customers of a security breach involving the unauthorized access or use of the customer's information.\n\nSource. #7964, eff 1-1-04; ss by #8901, eff 7-1-07, EXPIRED: 7-1-15\n\nNew. #11015, eff 1-8-16",
